    "body": "Nice catch! Yeah I think if we wanted this PR to have absolutely zero change in behavior we could manually unconditionally clear _policyContainer_'s coop like we're doing in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9149/files#r1189510140 that you pointed out.\r\n\r\nAt the same time, it sounds we could maybe match implementations by inheriting here in the same-origin case. @hemeryar can you confirm that Chromium's implementation is doing that here (i.e., the `<embed>` element case). It still might be better to take care of that spec-behavior-change in a separate PR though, I'm not sure.",
